# CODEOWNERS - Simplified for Small Teams
# 
# This file ensures the Architect Lead reviews critical infrastructure changes.
# For a small team, we only protect CI/CD and configuration files.
# Component files can be reviewed by anyone on the team.

# =============================================================================
# CI/CD WORKFLOWS - Architect approval required
# =============================================================================
# Prevents unauthorized changes to deployment pipeline
/.github/workflows/ @cksagar

# =============================================================================
# CRITICAL CONFIGURATION - Architect approval required
# =============================================================================
# Protects build system and dependencies
/package.json @cksagar
/angular.json @cksagar

# =============================================================================
# EVERYTHING ELSE - Any team member can review
# =============================================================================
# Components, services, and other code can be reviewed by anyone
# No specific owner assigned - promotes team collaboration
